    "architecture": "Eliminates runtime CSS-in-JS serialization overhead by binding OKLCH perceptual color tokens directly to CSS Cascade Layers (@layer reset, tokens, recipes, utilities). Polymorphic React 19 primitives accept ref as a regular prop (removing forwardRef wrapper bloat) and synchronize design token mutations with a persistent Three.js WebGL PBR (Physically Based Rendering) shader studio and SQLite/PostgreSQL storage via Prisma v6.",
