    "architecture": "Prevents race-condition overselling during 50,000 RPS flash drops by executing a single atomic `prisma.commerceSku.updateMany({ where: { sku, availableStock: { gte: qty } }, data: { availableStock: { decrement: qty } } })` paired with an immutable `InventoryReservation` record.",
