    "architecture": "Protects downstream webhook consumers from cascading failures using a deterministic 3-state Circuit Breaker (`CLOSED`, `OPEN`, `HALF_OPEN`) combined with decorrelated full-jitter exponential backoff `sleep = random(0, min(capMs, baseMs * 2 ** attempt))` and Prisma v6 delivery telemetry.",
    "deepDive": [
      "Full-Jitter Exponential Backoff: Spreads retry spikes uniformly across `[0, base * 2^attempt]` to eliminate synchronized retry storms.",
      "Half-Open Probe Recovery: Permits a single canary delivery probe when transitioning from `OPEN` to `HALF_OPEN` before closing the circuit."
    ],
    "performanceAndSecurity": "Signs outgoing webhook payloads with HMAC-SHA256 timestamps and logs every delivery attempt in `WebhookEventLog`.",
