    "architecture": "Visualizes a global multi-region edge fleet on a Three.js 3D Fibonacci sphere while orchestrating controlled Chaos Engineering fault injections (`EdgeRegionCluster` + `ChaosExperimentLog` in Prisma v6). When a primary region is partitioned, traffic automatically drains and re-routes to healthy sibling regions to preserve 99.999% availability.",
